         <div type="commentary" subtype="frontmatter" xml:space="preserve"><p>The line numbering of this text had to be changed from lines 11-26 because, as C. Kreuzsaler, Tyche 34 (2019) 251-252 (KorrTyche 923) explains, the two fragments, which were published with a break at CPR 10 39 line 12, can in fact be joined together to create one continuous text.</p></div>
